---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const title = 'Privacy';
const description = 'Mailbox Atlas privacy policy: no accounts, no advertising trackers; an optional email signup.';
---
<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p>Mailbox Atlas is a static website. We don't run accounts, comments, advertising, or third-party tracking scripts, and we don't set cookies.</p>
  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>The site is hosted on GitHub Pages. GitHub processes technical request data (such as IP address) to deliver pages and keep the service secure. See <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub's privacy statement</a>.</p>
  <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
  <p>We link to provider and USPS pages, which have their own privacy policies. If links to a provider become affiliate links, that provider may know you arrived from this site.</p>
  <h2>Email updates</h2>
  <p>Some pages have an optional form to get our checklist and occasional update emails. If you sign up, your email address is sent to Brevo (Sendinblue SAS), the service that stores our list and sends the emails, under <a href="https://www.brevo.com/legal/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Brevo's privacy policy</a>. We ask you to confirm by email before anything is sent, we use your address only for these emails, and we don't sell or share it. Every email has a one-click unsubscribe link, and you can ask us to delete your address at any time using the contact below.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:ds59tmmv@mail.grokbot.com">ds59tmmv@mail.grokbot.com</a>.</p>
  <p class="meta">Effective November 19, 2026. Updated November 21, 2026 (contact added).</p>
</Base>
